0 }}>亮点：切换课程即切换记忆，不再从零交代</Text></Box></Box><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#1A2230', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.55, margin: 0, marginTop: 14 }}>每次提问自动携带当前课程资料上下文；回答按 escape-first 富文本渲染。</Text><Box style={{ width: 460, flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ width: 460, flexDirection: 'column', marginTop: 14 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>▪  上下文可见</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.45, margin: 0, marginTop: 4 }}>资料全文拼入 system prompt；单份 4000 字、总量 12000 字预算（F33）。</Text></Box><Box style={{ width: 460, flexDirection: 'column', marginTop: 14 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>▪  交互可靠</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.45, margin: 0, marginTop: 4 }}>安全 Markdown 防注入（F27 / F31），请求中按钮禁用防重复提交（F28）。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ width: 190, height: 32, background: '#1E4FA8', borderRadius: 4, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center', marginTop: 16 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>真实界面  2 / 7</Text></Box></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 30, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.3, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>AI 校园学习陪伴助手  ·  课程作业答辩</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.3, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>14 / 28</Text></Box></Slide>